<body>
<div type="letter">


<pb facs="1039157" n="7v"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center"><lb/>Viro Excellentissimo et Clarissimo <rs key="pers_DE-588-121297829" type="person"><abbr>Joh.</abbr> Henrico Stehelino</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person"><abbr>N. B.</abbr></rs></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Non accipies, ut spero, <rs key="pers_DE-588-121297829" type="person">Avuncule</rs> honoratissime, in deteriorem partem, quod literas ad Te dare,
      <lb/>Teque de valere Tuo interrogare tamdiu intermiserim, citius enim profecto me debito meo exsol<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>vissem, si licuisset. Nunc autem, quemadmodum Te nihil de pristino, quo me prosecutus es,
      <lb/>et pro quo mult<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Tibi <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me debentur grati<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, favore remisisse non dubito, ita vicissim pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sentes hasce literas me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> erga Te observanti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ternum pere<choice><orig><g ref="#nn">n̄</g></orig><reg>nn</reg></choice>atur<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> testes esse volo. Tuam
      <lb/>Tuorumque valetudinem optime interim se habuisse et etiamnum habere confido, Deumque
      <lb/>supplex oro, ut Te et familiam Tuam honoratissimam inposterum quoque prospera salute beare
      <lb/>dignetur. Misit mihi nuper <rs type="person">soror</rs> mea ad petitum meum variorum florum semina, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sibi
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Te data fuisse significavit, pro quibus adeo Tibi debitas ago gratias; <rs type="person">Mater</rs> <rs type="person">discipuli</rs> mei, in
      <lb/>cujus gratiam ego h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c semina <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <rs type="person">sorore</rs> petieram, illa <date>postridie</date> quam accepit terr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> i<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>isit cu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>riose expectans, quales flores prolatura sint. Non dubito Te jam intellexisse rem cum <rs type="person">discipulo</rs>
      <lb/>meo non bene succedere, ita ut coactus sim illum <rs type="person">Matri</rs> su<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> relinquere. Alia mihi et quid<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> Viro nobili oblata est conditio, quam tamen repudiavi nolens ex Char<choice><orig><g ref="#ydots">ÿ</g></orig><reg>y</reg></choice>bdi in Sc<choice><orig><g ref="#ydots">ÿ</g></orig><reg>y</reg></choice>llam inci<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dere et ita alienis co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>odis inservire, ut mea prorsus negligam; propositum itaque mihi est
      <lb/>ex his regionibus quam primum discedere, et volente Deo iter in <rs key="place_VER-frankr" type="place">Galliam</rs> instituere; petam
      <lb/>primo <rs key="place_GEO-2660646" type="place">Genevam</rs>, et postquam ibidem aliquandiu co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>oratus fuero me conferam <rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Lutetiam
      <lb/>Parisiorum</rs>. Si qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> negotia in itinere meo <rs key="place_GEO-2660646" type="place">Genev<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> vel <rs key="place_GEO-2988507" type="place">Parisiis</rs> vel alibi Tibi curare potero,
      <lb/>rogo ut ea mihi demandes, nihil enim magis exopto, quam ut ipso opere obsequium et
      <lb/>cultum meum Tibi testatum facere possem.</p>
  <closer>Vale et mihi fave. <dateline>Datum in <rs key="place_GEO-2660349" type="place">Hindelbanck</rs>
<pb facs="1039158" n="8r"/>
      <lb/><abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1710-04-19">19. Aprilis 1710</date>.</dateline> Salutem <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me plurimam <rs key="pers_DE-588-1333493304" type="person">uxori</rs> et <rs type="person">liberis</rs> Tuis charissimis.</closer>
</div>
